    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n114771" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσ-άνθεμον</span></b> , τό,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλίχρυσον</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				4.57
			</span></i> (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσάνθεμος</span></b> ,
